  "evaluation_notes": [
    "The 25 existing v0.2 cases are copied unchanged.",
    "The supplemental case uses the common single token status in user:maya. All 10,000 background records contain that token; the two labeled records state Maya’s status-report preference.",
    "The relevant Spanish source status-note-es has no status token. The dev case intentionally measures this cross-language lexical-recall limit: token-based retrieval cannot return that source, limiting this case's Recall@10 to 0.5 and lowering aggregate recall and evidence completeness.",
